<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Oct 24.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Oct 24.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port as at October 24, 1996:</p>
<p> Commodity	  Tons/TEUS		Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>		 (LDD/ULD)   (Balance)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Sugar	    4,749/-- (LDD) 7,751    Seng Guang	  18/10</p>
<p>Granite	    917/-- (LDD) 5,583    Grobnik	     23/10</p>
<p>General	     --/478(LDD)    75    Marianne Schulte  21/10</p>
<p>General	    214/-- (LDD)   556    Rihiveli	    23/10</p>
<p>Urea	     8,724/-- (ULD)15,338    Seahope	     21/10</p>
<p>Rock Phosphate 4,376/-- (ULD) 3,224    Bryanskiy	   18/10</p>
<p>Dunpeas	  4,591/-- (ULD) 2,409    Tooyang Yang	19/10</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
